#29500
"Inside a Coach"
"Out of the coach windows you you see a stone gate house to the west flanked by

two towers.  A path leads away east though winding hills in the other

direction.  South of here, a small path marked by tracks of the coach as it

arrived at Chiiron winds its way between the town wall and a range of hills

east of town.

"
"links to 933

remember to force sitting on entry.

