#29501
"Inside a Coach"
"This worn, hilly trail is dotted with sparse grass, but the dirt here is

much too dry for most other vegetation.  To the north this faint trail

intersects with a path just east of Chiiron's city gates, and the trail

continues to the south along the east wall of Chiiron to the west.

