#29503
"Inside a Coach"
"This worn dirt trail leads north and south along the stone walls of

Chiiron to the west.  A few sparse patches of grass grow here and there,

but the hilly soil is much too dry to support any extensive vegetation. 

From far to the north you can hear the clank-clank of the east gate of

Chiiron.

